\*afraid to say otherwise\*

&amp;#x200B;

well, maybe not but it does make for easier conversation.

Very true, and if I came off as dismissive to that reality, then maybe I should have been a little clearer.

&amp;#x200B;

Many of us, me included, live in the middle of highly religious communities that shun those that think differently. This makes it highly difficult to have a conversation about death and it's nature without having to swallow alot of platitudes about how "God has a plan" and "The lord works in mysterious ways."

&amp;#x200B;

I think we agree in that sometimes its just easier to agree than it is to be honest.
